  <h2 id="service">1. The service</h2>
  <p>
    ForgeFit is a workout logger and AI-assisted training planner. Features include exercise logging,
    training plans and templates, progress tracking, body measurements and progress photos,
    achievements and ranks, Apple Health–based recovery insights, AI-generated workout suggestions and
    coaching, programme critique, and optional social features.
  </p>
  <p>
