    <li>You are responsible for keeping your password secure and for activity under your account.</li>
    <li>The information you provide must be accurate. You can update it in <em>Settings → Profile</em>.</li>
    <li>One account per person. Do not share login credentials.</li>
    <li>
      You may use guest mode without registering. Guest accounts are tied to a single device, if you
      lose or reset the device without registering, that data cannot be recovered.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="subscriptions">3. Subscriptions and payments</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>ForgeFit V1 is free.</strong> All current features are available at no cost and no
